  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1325695/description_d8efb203-df45-40f9-88b2-22fd557d364e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"149\"></p>\n<p>《秘魯盛宴》（Peruvian's Delight）是《農夫樂事》模組的擴充套件。它新增了生物、作物、食物、樹木、食譜、木材與方塊（後續還將推出更多內容）。所有這些元素均與秘魯文化緊密相連。遊戲中加入了最具代表性的秘魯佳餚，並搭配貼近現實且符合《我的世界》核心精神的製作系統。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>必要模組</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffarmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>展示</strong></h1>\n<h2><strong>酪梨與檸檬樹</strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1325695/description_5eb4d504-3278-4bab-a3ad-acb54c462624.png\" width=\"732\" height=\"485\"></p>\n<h2><strong>黃辣椒 (Aj&iacute; Amarillo)</strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1325695/description_73a5aa6d-f00e-45b0-ab9a-df535b83dd93.png\" width=\"734\" height=\"411\"></p>\n<h2><strong>生薑</strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1325695/description_2c2a4412-5d1c-4aae-8079-70ce68299e79.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>黃豆</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1325695/description_eb38994e-4ebb-423c-abf5-90569e71483a.png\" width=\"729\" height=\"468\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>地瓜</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1325695/description_267937bc-96f3-4005-90da-8a8cfec40353.png\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>木薯</strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1325695/description_dbd3cbc5-8d25-4a20-976e-2dce8f84f67e.png\" width=\"722\" height=\"476\"></p>\n<h2><strong>仙人掌果</strong></h2>\n<h2><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1325695/description_dbbc36f7-abbd-440b-847d-d004196528c1.png\" width=\"724\" height=\"476\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
